  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0\n\t\t\t✔️ Added field support for components with custom GraphQL content\n\n\t\t\tv1.3.0\n\t\t\t✔️ Add CancellationToken support\n\t\t\t✔️ GetEditingLayout version argument is deprecated and ignored; use the overload without it\n\t\t\t🐛 Pre-parse UserAgent header before passing to GraphQL client as some headers cause failures\n\n\t\t\tv1.2.1\n\t\t\t✔️ Updated dependency on Common library to 1.2.1\n\n\t\t\tv1.2.0\n\t\t\t⭐ Update GraphQl execution methods with extra parameters for variables, headers and operation name\n\t\t\t⭐ Add GraphQLException to surface errors when a custom query does not execute properly\n\n\t\t\tv1.1.1\n\t\t\t🐛 Bugfix Hyperlink fields when authoring and field is not set\n\n\t\t\tv1.1.0\n\t\t\tInitial public release",
